--// DOCA V1 FINAL "ALL-IN" RAINBOW + EVERYTHING ANIMATED PACK
--// Added for user request: real rainbow engine, RGB gradients,
--// neon sweep, animated strokes, title RGB, button hover glow,
--// live theme cycling, key UI rainbow mode, confetti burst,
--// loading progress shine, and one-call installer.
